# Hosts embedded in the release `nanocodex` binary that it never contacts.
# Reviewed for the OpenAI-only build; used by scripts/check-openai-only-hosts.sh.
# Format: <host>  <where it comes from>

docs.rs                      rustls/reqwest panic and error messages
github.com                   clap "file a bug report" panic text; syntect grammar comments
example.com                  placeholder citation URLs in model instructions
erlang.org                   syntect/two-face syntax definition metadata
groovy-lang.org              syntect/two-face syntax definition metadata
html.spec.whatwg.org         html5 parsing error references
mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org    MIME sniffing references
json-schema.org              JSON Schema $schema identifiers (jsonschema has no remote resolution)
ns.adobe.com                 XMP metadata namespace in image codecs
schemas.xmlsoap.org          XML namespace identifiers
www.webrtc.org               WebRTC RTP header extension identifiers
www.ietf.org                 WebRTC RTP header extension identifiers
